## 📝 Commit Message Format
```
<type>(<scope>): <subject>

<body>

<footer>
```

**Types:**
- `feat`: New feature
- `fix`: Bug fix
- `docs`: Documentation only
- `refactor`: Code refactoring
- `test`: Adding tests
- `chore`: Maintenance

**Example:**
```
feat(payouts): implement configurable rates

- Add admin UI for rate configuration
- Support Basic/Regular/Frequent packages
- Update payout calculation logic

docs: update feedback-tracking.md (1b completed)
```

